Files under upstream/ are unmodified copies of the original reviewer personas,
document standards, execution instructions and seven skill instructions with
their supporting references. The seven skills under skills/ are adaptations of
those instructions for BB, not the original upstream files. Their bundled
references include copies or excerpts of upstream materials; each registered
skill includes the Apache-2.0 license. server/prompts.ts uses the copied
personas and standards to assemble tool-less review requests.

Changes from upstream include tool-less OpenAI-compatible reviewer dispatch,
explicit human diff approval, durable version-bound review state and automatic
next rounds after confirmed changes. These adaptations are not endorsed by
Google or the upstream authors. No upstream NOTICE file was present at the
pinned commit.
